  "learning": {
    "goal": "掌握 Texture2D 贴图的完整接线：像素数据 → ImageAsset → Texture2D → 材质 mainTexture",
    "points": [
      "用 ImageAsset 包装程序化像素数据",
      "Texture2D.image 挂载图像资源",
      "USE_ALBEDO_MAP define + setProperty(\"mainTexture\") 启用反照率贴图"
    ]
  },
  "effect": {
    "functional": "checkerboard 像素数据经 ImageAsset 包装后挂到 Texture2D.image；材质 initialize 带 USE_ALBEDO_MAP define 并 setProperty(\"mainTexture\")；TexturedCube 使用该材质且持续自转。",
    "visual": "立方体六个面呈现灰白棋盘格纹理，随自转可确认纹理 UV 正确包裹（非纯色、非渐变）"
  },
